---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "員工專區"
permalink: /staff/
---
<h1>員工專區</h1>

<div class="staff-gate" id="staff-gate">
  <span class="staff-gate__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">admin_panel_settings</span>
  <h2 class="staff-gate__title">員工登入</h2>
  <p class="staff-gate__body">請輸入員工號以進入員工專區。</p>
  <p class="staff-gate__note">住院醫師及專科護理師登錄請填主治醫師之員工號</p>
  <div class="m3-field">
    <label for="staff-gate-input">員工號</label>
    <input type="text" id="staff-gate-input" class="m3-field__input" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off">
  </div>
  <p class="staff-gate__error" id="staff-gate-error" hidden>員工號錯誤,請重新輸入。</p>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn--filled staff-gate__submit" id="staff-gate-submit">
    確認
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
  </button>
</div>

<div id="staff-content" hidden data-codes="{{ site.staff_access_codes }}">
  <div id="staff-greeting" class="staff-greeting" hidden>
    <span class="staff-greeting__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">waving_hand</span>
    <p class="staff-greeting__text">
      <span class="staff-greeting__name" id="staff-greeting-name"></span>
      <span class="staff-greeting__sub">歡迎回來</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <p>以下功能僅供病房同仁使用。</p>

  <div class="category-grid">
    <a href="{{ '/beds/' | url }}" class="m3-card m3-card--success">
      <span class="m3-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">bed</span>
      <p class="m3-card__title">床位一覽</p>
      <p class="m3-card__desc">目前床位占用狀態、待排床位申請</p>
    </a>
    <a href="{{ '/beds/pre-admit/' | url }}" class="m3-card m3-card--tertiary">
      <span class="m3-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">bookmark_add</span>
      <p class="m3-card__title">預入病患卡床</p>
      <p class="m3-card__desc">給醫師或其他病房單位預先保留床位</p>
    </a>
    <a href="{{ '/staff/secret/' | url }}" class="m3-card m3-card--warning">
      <span class="m3-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">tips_and_updates</span>
      <p class="m3-card__title">密技</p>
      <p class="m3-card__desc">敬請期待</p>
    </a>
    <a href="{{ '/admin/' | url }}" class="m3-card m3-card--secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="m3-card__icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">edit_document</span>
      <p class="m3-card__title">內容管理後台</p>
      <p class="m3-card__desc">編輯網站內容(Decap CMS)</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
